{"id": "63019", "title": "公主无敌乱长安", "author": "桂圆八宝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 82, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63019.htm", "intro": "一个在街上漂泊了16年的姑娘，好不容易找到了父亲，却要远走大唐。在繁华的长安，又陷入到了皇权阴谋中。然而莲子是谁，说她是街头的小混混一点都不过，温柔娴熟洋洋不沾边，坑蒙拐骗倒是在行得很。于是无敌公主颠覆大唐、搅乱长安。李隆基、李宪、李白，三个绝世男人的世界因她而改变！", "base": "files/article/html/63/63019", "chapters": [{"title": "第 1 章", "file": "9340492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "9340494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "9340496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "9340498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "9340500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "9340502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "9340504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "9340505.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "9340507.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "9340508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "9340509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 12 章", "file": "9340510.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "9340512.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 14 章", "file": "9340514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "9340517.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 16 章", "file": "9340519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 17 章", "file": "9340520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 18 章", "file": "9340522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 19 章", "file": "9340525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 20 章", "file": "9340526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 21 章", "file": "9340527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 22 章", "file": "9340529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 23 章", "file": "9340531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 24 章", "file": "9340533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 25 章", "file": "9340535.html", "available": false}, {"title